  {
    "name": "records_paging_cursor",
    "given": {
      "accounts": [["{{acct:A}}", { "devices": [{ "device_id": "{{dev:D1}}", "label": "phone", "registered_ms": 1000 }] }]],
      "records": [
        ["{{acct:A}}", "bm", { "uuid": "u3", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a3", "ct": "c3" }],
        ["{{acct:A}}", "bm", { "uuid": "u1", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1001, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a1", "ct": "c1" }],
        ["{{acct:A}}", "bm", { "uuid": "u2", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1002, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a2", "ct": "c2" }],
        ["{{acct:B}}", "bm", { "uuid": "u0", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "b0", "ct": "other account" }]
      ]
    },
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/records?ns=bm&limit=2",
      "headers": [["authorization", "{{auth:A:D1:01}}"]]
    },
    "expect": {
      "status": 200,
      "body": {
        "records": [
          { "uuid": "u1", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1001, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a1", "ct": "c1" },
          { "uuid": "u2", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1002, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a2", "ct": "c2" }
        ],
        "next": "u2"
      }
    },
    "then": [
      {
        "request": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/records?ns=bm&limit=2&cursor=u2",
          "headers": [["authorization", "{{auth:A:D1:02}}"]]
        },
        "expect": {
          "status": 200,
          "body": {
            "records": [{ "uuid": "u3", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a3", "ct": "c3" }],
            "next": null
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "records_cross_uuid_tie_counter_bump",
    "native_only": "The native server breaks a cross-uuid HLC tie by reserving the next free counter in `ord` (canon::canonicalize_body step 3), which needs the whole stored namespace at once. A replica cannot see that, so the mesh uses order::tie_ord instead; see records_cross_uuid_tie_tie_ord.",
    "given": {
      "accounts": [["{{acct:A}}", { "devices": [{ "device_id": "{{dev:D1}}", "label": "phone", "registered_ms": 1000 }] }]]
    },
    "request": {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/records",
      "headers": [["authorization", "{{auth:A:D1:01}}"]],
      "body": {
        "ns": "bm",
        "records": [
          { "uuid": "u2", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a2", "ct": "c2" },
          { "uuid": "u1", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a1", "ct": "c1" }
        ]
      }
    },
    "expect": { "status": 200, "body": { "ok": true } },
    "then": [
      {
        "request": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/records?ns=bm",
          "headers": [["authorization", "{{auth:A:D1:02}}"]]
        },
        "expect": {
          "status": 200,
          "body": {
            "records": [
              { "uuid": "u1", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a1", "ct": "c1" },
              { "uuid": "u2", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a2", "ct": "c2", "ord": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 1, "node": "n1" } }
            ],
            "next": null
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "records_cross_uuid_tie_tie_ord",
    "mesh_only": "The mesh breaks a cross-uuid HLC tie with order::tie_ord (a function of hlc and uuid alone, so every replica agrees without coordinating), served where the native server serves its counter-bump `ord`: on each tied record but the lowest uuid. Native counterpart: records_cross_uuid_tie_counter_bump.",
    "given": {
      "accounts": [["{{acct:A}}", { "devices": [{ "device_id": "{{dev:D1}}", "label": "phone", "registered_ms": 1000 }] }]]
    },
    "request": {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/v1/records",
      "headers": [["authorization", "{{auth:A:D1:01}}"]],
      "body": {
        "ns": "bm",
        "records": [
          { "uuid": "u2", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a2", "ct": "c2" },
          { "uuid": "u1", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a1", "ct": "c1" }
        ]
      }
    },
    "expect": { "status": 200, "body": { "ok": true } },
    "then": [
      {
        "request": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/records?ns=bm",
          "headers": [["authorization", "{{auth:A:D1:02}}"]]
        },
        "expect": {
          "status": 200,
          "body": {
            "records": [
              { "uuid": "u1", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a1", "ct": "c1" },
              { "uuid": "u2", "hlc": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 0, "node": "n1" }, "deleted": false, "nonce": "a2", "ct": "c2", "ord": { "wall_ms": 1000, "counter": 0, "node": "n1~08c47d07" } }
            ],
            "next": null
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
]
